{"c":{"36309":["Narrator",null,"b36309-6KM0riV4lqfN.jpg","This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven't been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work.",2200],"87507":["Dandy","Male","87507-2p41KULKZKvx.png","A dandy guy in space who works as an alien hunter. His age is unclear, but he is most likely in his late 20s. He does not care about little things and believes that his dream is somewhere in the world. He frequents \"Boobies,\" a restaurant known for its voluptuous waitresses.",1496],"87509":["Meow","Male","87509-B3lwG2MUxVeV.png","Contrary to expectations, he's not a genetically advanced cat, but he's actually an alien that lives on the planet, Betelgeuse. Meow is very carefree, as if he were raised with no constraints.",273],"87729":["QT",null,"87729-2FHngCbNv6Tc.png","A member of Dandy's crew, a robot that resembles and also operates as a vacuum cleaner.",185],"87730":["Dr. Gel","Male","87730-TXHli1Uv7Igb.png","A gorilla-like scientist working for the Gogol Empire, Dr. Gel endlessly pursues Dandy from his spaceship.",37],"88672":["Perry Teitoku",null,"88672-ykGVLdL9YA2I.png","The ruler of the Gogol Empire, which is at war with the Jaicro Empire for control of the universe. He sends Dr. Gel to capture Dandy, claiming he is the key to the future of the universe.",9],"88675":["Honey","Female","88675-U7x1n1duYPx4.png","A blonde-haired waitress working at Boobies. She seems to enjoy the Aloha Oe crew's usual visits.",111],"88679":["Scarlet","Female","88679-YzCj6BNnXNGA.png","A collected, no nonsense inspector at the space alien registration center tasked with evaluating the aliens brought by Dandy and paying him accordingly when he brings her a worthy specimen.",73],"88682":["Adélie","Female","88682-3Msl9sxkqU6U.png","Adélie is a young Gentooan who Dandy meets on Planet Humbolt. Originally hunting her kind for a whopping 8 million woolong reward, Dandy takes a shine to her (and vice versa) and tries to put her in contact with another Gentooan (her grandfather).",58],"165560":["Prince","Male","b165560-R6vR6lQKiV2O.png","A handsome, blue haired racer adored by young women throughout the galaxy whom Dandy competes against in the Magellanic Nebula Grand Prix. He becomes Dandy's rival patron at BooBies.",10],"165561":["Meow's Mother","Female","b165561-NmenYlKFdyOj.png","The mother of Meow and his siblings. She lives in the family house on Planet Betelgeuse.",1],"165562":["Meow's Father","Male","b165562-aMzYmr5FW4Sf.png","The father of Meow and his siblings. He comes from a long line of metalworkers and runs a factory on Planet Betelgeuse, where he lives with his wife and kids.",5],"165565":["Toaster",null,"b165565-npcyIPnGEF0N.png","Toaster is a robot appliance that, like many other robots, was dumped at Dream Island due to developing some form of an emotion that made him unable to do his job.",1],"381669":["Bea","Male","b381669-g2jeyXMQy3C2.png","",2],"381672":["BooBies Gyaru","Female","default.jpg","",0],"381673":["BooBies Gyaru","Female","default.jpg","",0],"381674":["BooBies Gyaru","Female","default.jpg","",0],"381677":["Uchuujin-tachi",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381678":["Uchuujin-tachi",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381679":["Uchuujin-tachi",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381680":["Maboroshi no Ramen-ya no Oyaji","Male","b381680-hCKZ4KqZfXeF.png","",0],"381681":["Candy",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381682":["Andro Seijin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381683":["Menya Galaxy Tenin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381684":["Taiin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381685":["Mamitas","Female","b381685-KVRLCbCj2LMr.png","",1],"381688":["Dai-7 Kantai Taichou","Male","default.jpg","",0],"381689":["Raagi Seijin A",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381690":["Raagi Seijin B",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381691":["Senpai Uchuujin",null,"default.jpg","",0],"381692":["Nurse A","Female","default.jpg","",0],"381693":["Nurse B","Female","default.jpg","",0],"381694":["Isha","Male","default.jpg","",0],"381695":["Youhei A",